# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is git-ignored; never commit real keys.
#
# Nothing here is required today: both data sources (football-data.co.uk and
# Understat) are key-free. These are placeholders for sources the project will
# add later.

# TheSportsDB - club crests and player photos for the dashboard.
# Free tier: 30 requests/minute. https://www.thesportsdb.com/
# THESPORTSDB_KEY=

# football-data.org - optional cross-check of the live league table.
# Free tier: 10 requests/minute, current season only, no player statistics.
# https://www.football-data.org/client/register
# FOOTBALL_DATA_ORG_TOKEN=
